{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","猩红斩刑"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","奈拉高举斧头劈砍一名敌方英雄，对生命值较低的目标造成更高的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","该技能初始拥有750点能量。短暂蓄力后，对目标英雄造成320% + 35% ATK伤害。若目标生命值低于40%，则改为造成560% + 60% ATK的真实伤害。自动战斗时，不会对生命值高于40%的非首领敌方英雄使用。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":37,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":65,"end":71,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":61,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至330% + 35% ATK，对生命值较低的目标伤害提升至570% + 60% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":41,"end":47,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":37,"end":51,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至340% + 35% ATK，对生命值较低的目标伤害提升至580% + 60% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":41,"end":47,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":37,"end":51,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至350% + 35% ATK，对生命值较低的目标伤害提升至590% + 60% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":41,"end":47,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":37,"end":51,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至360% + 35% ATK，对生命值较低的目标伤害提升至600% + 60% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":41,"end":47,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":37,"end":51,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","铁索勾魂"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","将攻击距离外的敌方英雄钩到自己面前。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","自身普通攻击范围内没有敌方英雄时，将远处的一名敌方英雄钩到自己面前。目标英雄在被钩的过程中，每被拖拽1格的距离便会流失3.5% + 0.5%的当前生命值，最高不超过自身攻击力的250%。该效果不会导致目标英雄被击败，且本技能优先选择最接近对称位置的敌方英雄。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":63,"end":70,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":119,"end":121,"tooltip_key":"keyword:symmetric"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每被拖拽1格流失当前生命值的百分比提升至4% + 0.5%。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每被拖拽1格流失当前生命值的百分比提升至4.5% + 0.5%。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":31,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每被拖拽1格流失当前生命值的百分比提升至5% + 0.5%。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","狠厉踢踏"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","击飞并击倒敌人，随后造成多次伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","奈拉踢击面前的一名敌人，造成130% + 15% ATK伤害，将其击飞并击倒2秒，随后对其快速造成三次80% + 8% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":54,"end":59,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":51,"end":63,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","踢击伤害提升至140% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","踢击伤害提升至150% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","踢击伤害提升至160% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗中自身攻击力提升，参与击败敌人后攻击力获得额外提升。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身攻击力提升10%，参与击败一名敌人后额外提升15%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"}]],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身攻击力提升12%，参与击败一名敌人后额外提升17%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"}]],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身攻击力提升14%，参与击败一名敌人后额外提升20%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"}]],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","冥火焚恨"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","奈拉使用终极技能击败敌方英雄后，将爆发出一道可以伤害敌人并治疗友军的冲击波。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每当自身通过终极技能击败一名敌方英雄后，将爆发出一道半径2格的冲击波，对范围内所有敌人造成被击败目标最大生命值8%的伤害，并为范围内所有友军回复被击败目标最大生命值8%的生命值。本技能造成的伤害和治疗最高不超过自身攻击力的600%。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","对范围内敌人造成的伤害提升至被击败目标最大生命值10%，对范围内友军回复的生命值提升至被击败目标最大生命值10%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","当能量全满时，如果自身普通攻击范围外有生命值低于40%的敌人，则自身会尝试对该敌人使用“铁索勾魂”。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","对范围内敌人造成的伤害提升至被击败目标最大生命值15%，对范围内友军回复的生命值提升至被击败目标最大生命值15%。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","使用终极技能击败敌人后额外恢复能量。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每当自身通过终极技能击败一名敌人后，立即恢复250点能量。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","释放“铁索勾魂”时，自身进入3秒霸体状态，使目标受愈永久降低30点，并造成目标生命值20%的生命削减（不超过自身攻击力的250%），直至战斗结束。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":46,"end":50,"tooltip_key":"keyword:hpCut"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","碎魂钩斧"]]}